In all fairness, after sharing a reel about what’s wrong with certain packaged foods, I felt the need to share the healthy alternatives that actually exist.

There truly are better packaged food options with real ingredients that your kids will love just as much. The challenge is not knowing that they are available.

Making the commitment to choose better foods at home is essential for you and your kids well being. Because there will always be those times you aren’t in control, like at birthday parties, sleepovers, school events etc. all you can do is the best you can for the majority of the time 😉

